flowchart LR
  T[New task] --> M{verified cached skill?}
  M -- no --> DL[Dual-Lobe deliberation]
  DL --> WIN[verified success trace]
  WIN --> COMP[compile procedure + expected result]
  COMP --> SK[(skill cache)]
  M -- yes --> RUN[execute bounded skill]
  RUN --> CMP{expected vs actual}
  CMP -- match --> OK[retain]
  CMP -- repeated mismatch --> DEMO[demote to supervised]
